      * R0408BD - calling side: QTY is 3,0 but R0408BC expects 5,0.
      * Experiment: the length mismatch is not checked.
     H
     FQSYSPRT O   F     132            PRINTER
     C                     Z-ADD5         QTY     30
     C                     MOVEL'-'       FLG     1
     C                     CALL 'R0408BC'              85
     C                     PARM           QTY
     C                     PARM           FLG
     C                     EXCPT
     C                     SETON                     LR
     OQSYSPRT E
     O                         QTY        5
     O                                    7 '  '
     O                         FLG        8
     O                 85                25 'CALL FAILED'
